- Materials: GlassPanel uses the native `tsGlassPanel()` material (ADR-005) — no hand-rolled glass.
- Tokens only: Color.TS / Font.TS / TSSpacing / TSRadius — no hardcoded colors/typography.
- A11y: editor + catalog panels carry .accessibilityElement(children:.contain) + localized labels
