  the placeholder overlay is accessibilityHidden; each catalog cell combines name+description for VoiceOver;
  the status line is .isStaticText (web role="status"). Dynamic Type + light/dark/high-contrast inherited
  from the P2 dynamic-color tokens.
- Deep link: AppRouteParser resolves /power/dashboards via the new alias; round-trips through Spotlight
  (route.powerDashboards + spotlight.route.powerDashboards.description added).

